# The Shadow Visitor's face up close: dark, featureless, one red eye opens.
# Jump-scare image, full screen 320x180. Show for a few frames only, after
# a quiet build-up, with the jumpscare sound; with "reduce flashing" on,
# show the last frame without flicker. No gore (docs/decisions.md D9).
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 320 180
@output ../jumpscares/jumpscare_shadow_visitor.png
@preview ../previews/jumpscare_shadow_visitor_x2.png 2
@columns 1

@frame closed





















































































































































































@frame opening





















































































































































































@frame open




















































































































































































